---
import LandingLayout from '../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 24, 2026';
---

<LandingLayout
  title="Terms of Service | DSCRBroker.com"
  description="The terms that govern your use of DSCRBroker.com, a lead matching service that connects real estate investors with licensed DSCR loan brokers."
>
  <section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 px-4">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #131C31 0%, #0B1120 60%);" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm text-blue hover:text-blue-light transition-colors">Back to Home</a>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/40">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="legal-body mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <p>
            These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of DSCRBroker.com (the "Site") and the lead matching service we provide (the "Service"). By using the Site or submitting any form, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What DSCRBroker.com Is</h2>
          <p>
            DSCRBroker.com is a referral and matching service. We connect real estate investors with licensed, third-party DSCR loan brokers and their wholesale lending partners. <strong>We are not a lender, bank, or mortgage broker.</strong> We do not originate loans, make credit decisions, approve or deny financing, set rates or loan terms, pull credit, verify income, or fund mortgages. All lending activity is performed solely by the matched licensed broker and their lending partners, subject to their own guidelines and your qualifications.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Eligibility</h2>
          <p>You must be at least 18 years old and able to enter into a binding agreement to use the Service. DSCR loans are for non-owner-occupied investment properties only. Nothing on this Site is an offer to lend or a commitment to lend.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>The Matching Process</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>When you submit the form, we route your information to a licensed broker in your state based on the details you provide.</li>
            <li>The matched broker is an independent third party and is solely responsible for their own advice, communications, loan products, terms, and decisions.</li>
            <li>We do not guarantee that you will be matched, contacted, pre-qualified, approved, or funded, or that any particular result, rate, timeline, or term will be available.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>No Professional Advice</h2>
          <p>
            The content on this Site, including any calculators, the Deal Analyzer, program descriptions, and educational material, is for general informational purposes only. It is not financial, legal, tax, or lending advice, and it is not a loan offer, pre-approval, or commitment to lend. Estimates are illustrative and may differ materially from actual results. Always confirm details with a licensed professional.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your Responsibilities</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information.</li>
            <li>Use the Site only for lawful purposes and not to submit false, fraudulent, or unauthorized information.</li>
            <li>Do not attempt to disrupt, scrape, reverse engineer, or gain unauthorized access to the Site.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Consent to Communications</h2>
          <p>
            By submitting the form and providing consent, you authorize DSCRBroker.com and the matched broker to contact you at the phone number and email you provided, including by automated means and text message, regarding your inquiry. Consent is not a condition of any purchase. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details and how to opt out.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>The Site, its content, and its design are owned by DSCRBroker.com or its licensors and are protected by applicable laws. You may not copy, reproduce, or redistribute the Site or its content without permission.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>The Site may link to third-party websites and services we do not control. We are not responsible for their content, policies, or practices. Accessing them is at your own risk.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
          <p>
            The Site and Service are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or secure, or that any matched broker will meet your expectations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, DSCRBroker.com and its owners, employees, and affiliates will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss arising out of your use of the Site or Service, your interactions with any matched broker, or any loan you do or do not obtain. Our total liability for any claim relating to the Service will not exceed one hundred dollars ($100).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Indemnification</h2>
          <p>You agree to indemnify and hold DSCRBroker.com harmless from any claims, losses, or expenses arising out of your use of the Site, your violation of these Terms, or your dealings with any matched broker or lender.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Equal Housing Opportunity</h2>
          <p>All participating brokers in the DSCRBroker.com network are equal opportunity lenders. Loans are available regardless of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, handicap, or familial status, in accordance with the Fair Housing Act.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date reflects the latest version. Continued use of the Site after changes means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:legal@dscrbroker.com">legal@dscrbroker.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-body h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .legal-body p { font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .legal-body ul {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      list-style: disc;
    }
    .legal-body li { font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    .legal-body a { color: #3B82F6; text-decoration: underline; }
    .legal-body a:hover { color: #60A5FA; }
    .legal-body strong { color: #E2E8F0; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</LandingLayout>
